  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Easy Answers**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **The Other One Jam**: rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Hurts Me Too [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **DeadCo2018-06-02.travitz.schoepsMK4v.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 106 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer describes the recording as clean, with a nice up-front sound [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Thunderstorms in Camden forced the second set to end abruptly [1]\n- Tempos are quicker than the previous tour and closer to 1980s pacing, though the reviewer still finds them too slow [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **DeadCo2018-06-02.travitz.schoepsMK4v.flac16**: taped by Jeff Travitz; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK4V's>KCY 250/5i>Schoeps VST5u>SD744t [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK4V mics into a Sound Devices 744T at 16-bit/44.1kHz, then converted to FLAC, with fades added in Sound Forge Pro 11 [1]",
